WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:02.770
We will now continue our 
search for the hawk.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:17.800
<i>That's...</i>

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.820
<i>The Hawk of Light!</i>

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:37.450
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.310
<i>Why is it here?</i>

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.740
What the...

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:44.600
Who do you—

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:45.680
Huh?

00:00:58.570 --> 00:00:59.550
My lord!

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.250
Don't just stand there, idiots!

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.250
Kill him!

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:05.670
Fire!

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:07.040
Wait!

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:15.230
None of them hit him...

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:18.660
He avoided all of them?

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.430
But there were so many!

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.400
Idiots! Quit gawking!

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:28.020
Fire another volley!

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:31.850
What the...

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:40.190
<b><i>Banner of the Flying Sword</i></b>

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:11.140
Are you one of his men?

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.880
Kill him, too!

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:20.940
Who's that warrior?

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:22.040
He's a monster!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.950
Stand your ground... They are only two!

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.910
Hurry and kill that one!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:39.550
My enemies, your pardon 
for being on horseback.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.140
My name is Locus.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:45.570
Divine revelation has 
led me to this land.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.300
I believe you are the Hawk of Light.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.470
Am I correct?

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.840
Sir Locus, the Moonlight Knight.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.460
I accept your sword.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.790
A great honor!

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:57.430
The Hawk of Light...

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.910
The Hawk... It isn't possible.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.930
I heard he died.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:05.680
No, I saw his face at the 
Windham victory parade.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:07.090
There's no mistaking it.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.830
He is Midland's true guardian deity.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.150
<i>It's him!</i>

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:21.240
<i>That is him!</i>

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.150
Hey, you!

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:24.150
Hey, watch out!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:25.740
<i>Griffith!</i>

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.510
<i>The wind whispered to me.</i>

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:33.770
<i>That now is when the world 
begins to change.</i>

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:37.640
Stop them!

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:39.520
Stop those two!

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:40.550
My lord.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:41.380
Wait.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:44.720
There is no advantage to be had 
by currying favor with this lot.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:48.390
Instead, let us use the chaos
and capture the hawk.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:52.560
<i>He is so beautiful.</i>

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.750
<i>Almost as if he isn't human.</i>

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:01.320
Watch out!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:07.710
Impossible.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:10.260
We were repelled?

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.050
Slow. Dull of edge.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:19.800
These are Tapasa, the best of 
the Bakiraka? How pitiful.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.500
That mask!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.090
You're Raksas!

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:25.590
<i>Why is the clan's exile here?</i>

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.800
I was given a prophecy.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.100
So you are the Hawk of Light.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.330
You're beautiful.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:40.910
Someday, I will cut off your 
head and make it mine.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:51.080
Until then, I will let no one harm you.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.870
It's playtime.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:05.800
Shut the castle gates!

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.830
Close off their escape route!

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:14.420
A giant?

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:15.950
Naga?

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:18.990
Stand your ground. There is but one foe.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.150
To arms!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.870
I have a message!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.440
All men, to arms!

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.180
What the...

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.620
Who are you?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:53.640
<i>What a nauseating stench...</i>

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:59.580
<i>My mind's numb from the 
overwhelming scent of blood.</i>

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.990
<i>Everything is dyed red.</i>

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:07.140
<i>Everything is stained red,</i>

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:10.280
<i>red as the setting sun casts 
its rays on the blood...</i>

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.330
<i>The sight should be gruesome, and yet...</i>

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:21.320
<i>And yet it was like a painting, 
beautiful beyond compare.</i>

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:30.320
<i>Without a doubt, we were all in 
a tale beyond comprehension.</i>

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:51.860
Please let us accompany 
you on your journey.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.750
Come, you kneel, too.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:57.610
What do you want?

00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:58.990
This is fishy as hell!

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.870
What's with the complete about-face?

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:03.620
The first chance they get, 
I bet they'll tie us up!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.850
I have already secularized myself...

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:07.930
I am no longer with the Order.

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:10.880
We can't trust you! 
You're a bloody aristocrat!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.630
I want to know the truth

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:16.210
that transcends the ordered 
system to which I clung.

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.450
And I want to learn

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:22.390
how to survive in the darkness, 
where order's light does not reach.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.350
<i>To learn from you.</i>

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.000
Please guide us.

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:38.790
You can use big words to talk in 
circles, but I won't be duped!

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.660
Yeah, not gonna be duped.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:43.410
How are you gonna make up 
for what you did to Casca?

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.490
How you gonna make it up?

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:46.670
She was almost burned alive!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.390
If you say enemies can 
become friends overnight,

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:52.830
maybe you should throw yourself 
on the ground and apologize, eh?

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:55.240
Can you manage that, you smug noble?

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.500
Oh, yeah? You wanna fight?

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.800
B-Bring it!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.030
This is all I can do now.

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:11.690
I swear I shall make amends.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:18.200
Say any more, and you'll be the villain.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:23.010
Why are priests and nobles 
so over the top?

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:24.710
Do what you want.

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:26.460
Th-Then...

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:28.450
Well, that was quick.

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:31.790
I don't need you to make 
amends or apologies.

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:35.000
I killed your guys, too. 
It goes both ways.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:38.380
But no thanks to being your guide.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:39.540
Not my thing.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.210
I don't know what you want to 
learn, but do what you like.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.580
Stay out of my way, 
and I won't interfere.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:47.730
We are grateful.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:49.720
No need for that yet.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:55.080
Coming with us means you won't 
be able to sleep at night.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:55.790
Oh?

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.970
So we'll run into more ghosts 
and monsters and stuff?

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.740
J-Just what I want!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.640
<i>Something's weird.</i>

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:06.260
<i>Why would Guts let people he 
doesn't know into his circle?</i>

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.190
<i>If it were just me...</i>

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:16.250
<i>If I were my usual self, I'd have 
turned them down in a second.</i>

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.260
<i>But this time, I'm in a bind.</i>

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:24.110
Go and gather firewood.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:22.320
<i>It's the first time</i>

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.670
<i>I find myself counting on 
people I don't know.</i>

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.940
Don't let the fire go out tonight.

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:27.720
Why do you get to order us around?

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:31.020
<i>I am horrified by my own malice.</i>

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:36.030
<i>I feel crushed by powerlessness.</i>

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.510
<i>When was the last time she smiled?</i>

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:00.830
<i>I'm not doing this for the royal house</i>

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.650
<i>or to uphold my honor!</i>

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.220
<i>It's to</i>

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:05.600
<i>save my people!</i>

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:08.880
Stand your ground!

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:11.480
Follow me!

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:15.810
What the...

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:17.820
A Midland hostage?

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.410
Fire at will!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:22.650
Fire!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.830
<i>They're firing volleys right 
through their own men!</i>

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.630
Cavalry, charge!

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:32.960
Annihilate them!

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:35.460
Is this the end?

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.290
<i>Watch out!</i>

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:44.350
What?

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:53.800
<i>Reinforcements?</i>

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:56.760
New forces on the right flank!

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.800
On the left flank, too!

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:12.180
Wh-Who are they?

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:22.630
That's...

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.800
That banner!

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:40.690
<i>There...</i>

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:44.960
<i>A spot of emptiness.</i>

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:48.830
<i>And along its path, the center 
of the enemy focus!</i>

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:53.980
<i>Lord Griffith!</i>

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.230
H-He's flying!

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.820
<i>Unbelievable.</i>

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:41.340
<i>Is this really a battlefield?</i>

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:43.150
<i>Look at their peaceful smiles.</i>

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:46.660
<i>They hardly look like people 
devastated by a foreign army.</i>

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.420
It's because of Lord Griffith.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:53.370
Griffith... You mean that white hawk?

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:57.100
We can smile because 
Lord Griffith is with us.

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:01.510
<i>Did this girl just read my mind?</i>

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.490
Welcome to the Band of the Hawk.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:13.710
<i>These men have such high morale!</i>

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:16.900
Kushans!

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:18.940
Are they Kushan men?

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:19.820
That's right.

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:20.980
Wait a minute...

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.140
What's going on? Why are 
our foes helping us?

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:25.640
Could you please stop yelling?

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:26.760
They defected.

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:29.840
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.830
<i>What an intimidating man...</i>

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:34.220
It is our code.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:38.400
Prisoners must stand on the 
front lines three times.

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:42.160
Those who survive the arrows 
choose defection or death.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:46.590
Those who choose to be allies will 
not suffer discrimination

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:49.060
and may rise through our ranks.

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:51.660
Depending on circumstance, 
they may even lead others.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.370
That's ridiculous!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.510
How can you trust former 
foes to lead other men?

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:58.750
Even the Kushan Empire 
is not a monolith.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:04.470
It is governed by a ruling clan that 
subjugated various others.

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:07.390
Many clans still nurse grudges.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.170
But still...

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:12.530
What of us Midlanders?

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:16.720
The suffering of people who lost 
homes, cities, and families?

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.510
Though both sides may harbor hatred, 
we are ultimately all human beings.

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:24.690
Should you choose to stay,

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:29.120
you will learn that former foes are 
more similar than you realize.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:32.220
Who was that knight?

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:33.640
Sir Locus.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.570
He's in charge of training new recruits.

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:37.660
Locus!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.940
You mean Sir Locus, 
the Moonlight Knight?

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.410
I thought that might surprise you.

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:44.210
All the nobles are.

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:47.250
<i>He's won countless accolades in combat.</i>

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:52.630
<i>While being undefeated in duels, 
he has never chosen a master.</i>

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.130
<i>Instead, he's remained a free man, 
the strongest warrior alive.</i>

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:57.730
<i>Why is such</i>

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.520
<i>a living legend here?</i>

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:06.190
There are things that will probably 
surprise you even more.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:10.210
As Sir Locus said, you'll be surprised 
by more than Kushan defectors.

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:12.660
This is a shortcut.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:14.770
Hup.

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:22.270
<i>What is the ominous presence 
in this forest?</i>

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:24.420
<i>Beasts...</i>

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:26.310
<i>A pack of wolves?</i>

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:28.100
Hey, wai—

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:39.230
You didn't notice them?

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:41.670
They were working hard during 
the fight earlier, too.

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:43.480
We call them the demon army.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:45.480
<i>The demon army!</i>

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:52.430
They're better now, though they 
may not look it.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:55.250
Before, they'd sometimes 
eat our Kushan prisoners.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:03.210
G-Girl, you've come alone again?

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.960
Just let me go, will you? Perv.

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:07.480
Hey, let go of—

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:08.250
Whoa!

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.880
I-It'd be great to eat human flesh again!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.170
I'll tell Lord Griffith.

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:16.970
N-Not that!

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:24.280
G-Grunbeld...

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:33.920
They are our master's valued guests.

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:36.400
Harm them, and you 
will answer to me.

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.570
J-Just kidding!

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.110
I was just joking around...

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:41.490
<i>Grunbeld... I know that name!</i>

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:45.440
<i>The mighty warrior who defended 
a small northern kingdom</i>

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:48.000
<i>from the massive Chuder invasion</i>

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.500
<i>for a decade, with a mere 
force of three thousand.</i>

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:53.720
<i>The great fire dragon.</i>

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:57.260
<i>They say he fell in battle, but...</i>

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.940
Lady Sonia, you are too reckless.

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:01.820
Though you are our seer,

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:04.790
you should not walk here 
without a guard.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:09.080
Next time, please speak to me first.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.610
Okay.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.500
<i>The seer for the Hawks?</i>

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.430
Who are these people?

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:21.120
I don't really know a whole lot.

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:24.970
<i>A mysterious army of inhuman beings.</i>

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:27.700
<i>Heroes whose names are known 
throughout the world.</i>

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:29.240
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:37.430
I've brought Lord Griffith's guest.

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:46.910
<i>What is that?</i>

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.500
People who died in battle today.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:55.240
After the battle ends, they gather 
like this at sundown.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.690
<i>Souls? Of the dead?</i>

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:03.580
So beautiful...

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:09.540
And who are they?

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:12.610
The family and loved ones of the dead.

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.460
They're here to say farewell.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.940
Hey, where's Dad?

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:23.390
Dad!

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:24.920
Dear!

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:29.690
Take care.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.580
My dear...

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:48.460
It's over.

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.500
Lord Griffith!

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:55.280
Good work earlier today, Sonia.

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:57.500
It was nothing.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:02.630
I think I'm more powerful when 
I'm with you, Lord Griffith.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.110
<i>So this man is the white hawk...</i>

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:13.690
That group of lights... 
Where is it going?

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.370
To where they can be one.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.290
Where they can be one? 
Where is that?

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:23.770
Heaven? Or...

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:25.560
Eventually, you will know.

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:27.530
Everyone does when their time comes.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:31.390
We have yet to meet 
formally, Lord Mule.

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:35.290
I am Griffith, leader of 
the Band of the Hawk.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.700
F-Forgive my belated introduction!

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.850
I am Mule Wolflame.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:45.440
Youngest son of Valagar 
Wolflame, lord of Lumias.

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:49.400
I have no words to express 
my deep gratitude

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:54.120
for the salvation of my people 
in the earlier battle!

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.270
I, as well, must offer my gratitude.

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:01.660
The food you have provided 
will allow my troops

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.700
to fight for many more months.

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:06.290
Y-You are too kind.

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:08.550
<i>What is this?</i>

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:12.280
<i>What is this powerful emotion 
I feel welling up from within?</i>

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:15.560
<i>It surges... forth.</i>

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.750
Please accept my sword.

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:28.470
Please.

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.600
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:36.840
<i>I only just met this man and 
exchanged a few words.</i>

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:41.610
<i>And yet, I hear a voice from the 
deepest reaches of my being...</i>

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:44.110
Lord Griffith?

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.250
<i>A powerful voice... I cannot ignore!</i>

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:52.810
<i>It says this is my destiny.</i>

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:28.670
They're coming, Isidoro!

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:30.000
I know!

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:33.010
Lady Farnese, please keep 
the fire going!

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:34.910
I... I am ready!

00:23:35.650 --> 00:23:37.100
No, Casca!

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:38.530
You cannot wander around!

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:41.230
Here they come!

00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:47.930
Come at me, you ghouls!

00:23:57.060 --> 00:24:00.960
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.040
<b>That was because you grabbed 
me in a strange manner!</b>

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:09.090
<b>Hey! My holiday best!</b>

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:13.390
<b>This is a magical ritual!</b>

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:17.560
<b>Isn't that what you've been 
doing all this time?</b>

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:21.560
<b>Welcome to the mansion 
of the spirit tree.</b>

00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:27.070
<b><i>Next Episode 
Forest of Demonic Beasts</i></b>
